Z||000000||fiero56||07-10-2000||09:12 PM||||Well, I will have my front lower and upper control arms out in the next week or so, and I am wondering what colors I should make the control arms and springs. Best suggestions so far have been blue and yellow, blue and red, and yellow and red.  I plan to paint my calipers red(maybe yellow???) very soon, so I would like something that goes along well with them.  Any ideas?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||07-10-2000||10:44 PM||||Purple is always a good choice.<P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||1
Z||000002||87ECO5||07-11-2000||08:33 AM||||Since we're best buds, I feel obligated to assist you in your decision, Drew.  Let's proceed ...<P>Do not paint them purple as Monkeyman "suggests".  What he's trying to do is lure you into a trap.  If you paint them purple, he'll accuse you of "copycatting" his idea.  As payback, he'll tie you down and "style your hair" like his - high and tight!  Of course, Drew with a shaved head might be an interesting sight!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Since you have a black car, you could paint them orange.  This would spark new love for you in BENGAL4's eyes, as he adores his Cincinnati football team!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>You could paint them bright blue then go to BroCar 87's thread titled "What do YOU call your FIERO?" and post that your nickname is "The Bruise!" - get it?  Black and Blue!?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>Well, I'm running out of stupid (and not very funny) suggestions so I'll segue into my official suggestions.<P>Of course, red would look good.  Warning - mine will be red after this weekend.  I don't care if yours are red too but we'll have to stop hanging out together so much, otherwise people will talk!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   Yellow might look good but I think it would depend on the shade of yellow - be careful there.  Other colors that I think would look REAL good on your car are (watch for the theme here) gold, copper, bronze, and magnesium.  Another option would be chrome.<P>Hope this helps ...||||reg||1
Z||000003||Spyder||07-11-2000||02:02 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/suspension.jpg"> <BR>Here is the pic of my colors.<P>If your car is black, go with the red calipers.||||reg||1
